{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"pass\": true, \"problems\": [], \"unexplained\": [{\"id\": \"S03-B2\", \"why\": \"池子太窄\", \"note\": \"这一短促、急切又迅速沉回去的起落没有被M20真正解释，但现有H2–H4已经足够提供前提：舍不得、尚未尽兴可以产生一瞬间想再多一点的冲动，而已有的真实满足又使它不必扩展成持续倾诉。无需改写前史，也没有理由怀疑这条听感本身。\"}], \"reason\": \"合格。M20原文未被改写，依赖的H2、H3、H4都有既有听感依据；它用“已经知道这种亲近的滋味，所以时间流逝变成所珍惜之物在减少”解释了B1的停留和B3的阻力，而不是只复述结果。最重要的B1得到了解释，B2作为次要短暂起落明确承认未被候选完整解释，没有被硬算进主解释。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "357226dd-3d19-442d-9506-be43ba932f8d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261027T222741287611Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-27T22:28:05.036604+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a4b326b3a4693b4f8482c5173728c2168ef94520d90aed4d7f5a830c92d47c4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7